:PNLGRP.
.*
:HELP name='RTVUSRAUT/ALL'.
:IMHELP name=RTVUSRAUT.
:IMHELP name='RTVUSRAUT/OBJ       '.
:IMHELP name='RTVUSRAUT/OBJTYPE   '.
:IMHELP name='RTVUSRAUT/USER      '.
:IMHELP name='RTVUSRAUT/AUT       '.
:EHELP.
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für den Befehl
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP NAME='RTVUSRAUT'.
Retrieve User Authority (RTVUSRAUT) - Help
:P.
The Retrieve User Authority (RTVUSRAUT) command retrieves a specific
user's authority for an object
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort OBJ
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='RTVUSRAUT/OBJ       '.
Object - Hilfe
:XH3.Object (OBJ)
:P.
Specifies the object for which you want to retrieve
information.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/REQPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Specify the name of the object for which the
authority is to be retrieved.
:EPARML.
:P.
Valid library values are:
:P.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.All libraries in the library list for the current
thread are searched until the first match is found.
:PT.:PV.*CURLIB:EPV.
:PD.The current library for the thread is searched. If no
library is specified as the current library for the
thread, the QGPL library is searched.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Specify the name of the library to be searched.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort OBJTYPE
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='RTVUSRAUT/OBJTYPE   '.
Object type - Help
:XH3.Object type (OBJTYPE)
:P.
Specifies the type of the object for which you want to
retrieve the information.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/REQPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.object-type:EPV.
:PD.Specify the type of the object for which information
is to be retrieved.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort USER
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='RTVUSRAUT/USER      '.
User - Help
:XH3.User (USER)
:P.
Specifies the user whose authority for the specified object
is retrieved.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*CURRENT:EPK.
:PD.The authority of the current user is retrieved.
:PT.:PV.*PUBLIC:EPV.
:PD.The authority of public users is retrieved.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Specify the name of the user.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort AUT
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='RTVUSRAUT/AUT       '.
CL var for AUT          (10) - Help
:XH3.CL var for AUT          (10) (AUT)
:P.
Specifies a 10-character variable used to return the authority.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*====================================================================
.*  Textbausteine, die an mehreren Stellen im Hilfetext
.*  verwendet werden.
.*====================================================================

.*=====================================
.*  Erforderlicher Parameter
.*=====================================
:HELP NAME='COM/REQPARM'.
:P.
This is a required parameter.
:P.
:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
:EHELP.

.*=====================================
.*  Optionaler Parameter
.*=====================================
:HELP NAME='COM/OPTPARM'.
:P.
This is an optional parameter.
:P.
:IMHELP name='COM/VALUES'.
:EHELP.

.*=====================================
.*  Werteliste
.*=====================================
:HELP NAME='COM/VALUES'.
:P.
The possible values are:
:EHELP.
.*
:EPNLGRP.
